<title>UKRAINE: Ukraine has $846 mln trade deficit in Jan-Nov 1996.</title>
<headline>Ukraine has $846 mln trade deficit in Jan-Nov 1996.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ukraine posted a trade deficit of $846 million in the first 11 months of last year, the Statistics Ministry said on Tuesday.</p>
<p> UKRAINE MERCHANDISE TRADE   Jan-Nov 96  Jan-Oct 96  Jan-Nov 95</p>
<p> Exports (million $)		 12,566	11,443	10,223</p>
<p> Imports (million $)		 13,412	11,991	 9,764</p>
<p> Balance (million $)		   -846.0	-548.7	+459.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are for trade with all countries. Trade with former Soviet republics resulted in a deficit of $1.32 billion.</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
</text>
